{"crw-nogi-5107":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント有難うございました。\nほんとーにうれぴーぽーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島にこれないけど応援してくださるみたで、\nそして来てくださるかたも何人かいて...............沸いてるまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の靴を噛むラグチャン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噛んだ後は何事もなかったように......シラーっとする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっても×2靴を噛むのはゆうこと聞いてくれない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では気を取り直して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はろってぃ家でみた面白いものを紹介します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは乃木ここでも言ってたように、ろってぃ家にある、大きな絵をご紹介します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きすぎて縦向きに撮っちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ家を探検していると     小さな写真もございまして......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縦に撮っちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライオン飼っていてもおかしくないゾッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだまだ面白いのは沢山ありましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃちゃんとはオーディションの時に一緒に時間が空いたとき、ランチを食べたりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんもミニャミもっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初から仲良しなんだぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんは今よりめっちゃ痩せてた！くけけけっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエット×2って言って、明日から×2って言ってるせいたんすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニャミは、前もかわいかったけどもっともっと\nめっちゃ可愛くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまあやの妹みたい←ミニャミにおこられちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなこと言ったんは内緒なっ！？\n皆の事........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しスタート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 好きないろは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 紫、ピンク、緑！最近は青もすきよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qバレーとかみるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 見るよー！よくお父さんとする！\n地元帰ってもやった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q料理する時、本を読みながら作るの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 最近は見ないでやってるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q料理にはまってるの？中間テストは無事に終了ってことかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A はまってる！ぶじ終了した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q メンバーに手料理を食べてもらったことはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ないかもー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q握手会で何話そうか迷う！なんか希望はある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A なにはなそー？ドキドキ！わら\n希望？うーん！なんだろ？いっぱいある！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qお好み焼き苦手なんですけど克服する方法をおしえて？\n男のレギンスはありですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A なんできらいなーん？         レギンス？     ピタッとしたやつかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qオムライスの中はチキンライスではすか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A そうですよーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今日もスマイルやんりょるか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A しとるよー！        スマイルニコニコ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q乃木坂で一番遊ぶこはだれ？よくいくコンビニは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 今日はろってぃと遊んだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qふだんからも料理してるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A するよー洗濯物とか色々ー！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qナルトで一番感動したシーンは？ナルトはTVで見てるの？\n今年のナルトの映画は見に行く？\n好きなキャラクターは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ナルトは感動シーンが多すぎて説明不可能です！sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q まあやって素敵な名前だよね！       誰につけてもらったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ありがとー！お父さんだよっ！へへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 皿うどんたべたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A あるかもー？でも違うかな？\nどんなんだっけぇ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ答えれてないのがあるから......まっててー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは髪の毛伸ばしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは切りたいーめっちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってのびたもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/01/2459915/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-20627":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝晩がだいぶ肌寒くなりましたね～。\n日中は動いていると汗ばむ感じですが10月に入って衣替えの季節でもあるから、ブログタイトル大草原から日だまりにお引越しだよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/03/9696364/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大草原から♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日だまり日だまり(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は期末考査でレッスンに出られなかった分と、\n日々の学校でレッスンを遅れて参加するということもあり...\nアンダーライブリハ...もう必死だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の中...いっぱいいっぱいで泣けてきたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙を流してしまった時にね、川後のひなさんが日奈をぎゅって抱きしめて、「大丈夫大丈夫...。学校もあって大変だよね...。一緒に頑張ろう。」って言って、涙をふいてくれたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その優しさとあたたかさに、さらに涙が溢れた（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「泣いてなんかいられない！頑張るんだ！！絶対にみんなで成功させるんだ！」って強い気持ちになれたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーもみんな声をかけてくれて嬉しい...。とても心強いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員が支え合って全力で取り組んでいる今回のアンダーライブ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんお楽しみにしていて下さいね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな...ライブを全力で楽しみます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/03/9696364/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のひなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き（；＿；）♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し短いですが、今日はこのへんで..."},{"typ